*IQ* What is Wrapper class?
        -- A Wrapper Class is a class that converts a primitive data type into an object.
------------------------
*IQ* Integer a = 100;
     Integer b = 100;
     System.out.println(a == b);  // true

     but:
     Integer a = 200;
     Integer b = 200;

     System.out.println(a == b);  // false

     WHY?
        -- Because Java caches Integer values from -128 to 127
